WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.467
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.868
This is "Late Night." We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:05.334
Now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:08.701
While speaking yesterday at the
White House's tribal summit,

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:11.400
President Biden discussed
his high school football career

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.434
and claimed to have been
the runner-up

00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:15.067
in the state
scoring championship.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:16.400
Well, I don't know
how to tell you this,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.200
but runner-up
isn't good enough!

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:22.734
The Republican National
Committee held its fourth

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:25.567
and final presidential debate
last night in Alabama.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:27.901
And based on what I saw,
here are my predictions.

00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:29.033
Fox News morning show.

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:30.667
Couple books nobody will read.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:32.000
"Dancing with the Stars."

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.133
Steps in a bucket

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:34.467
and the bucket
gets stuck on his foot

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.567
and he falls off the porch.

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:39.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:41.000
During last night's
Republican debate,

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.834
entrepreneur Vivek Ramaswamy
expressed support

00:00:43.834 --> 00:00:47.267
for several conspiracy theories,
including the far-out idea

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:49.868
that Vivek Ramaswamy
could become president.

00:00:49.868 --> 00:00:52.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.534
House Republicans yesterday
rejected Hunter Biden's

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:57.300
offer to testify publicly
in front of Congress

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.934
as part of the impeachment
inquiry into President Biden,

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:01.601
and have threatened
to hold him in contempt

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:03.767
if he does not appear in
a closed-door session.

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:06.701
In Hunter Biden's defense,
you get him behind closed doors,

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:08.334
things tend to get
a little freaky.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:11.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:12.834
In a post this week
on Truth Social,

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:15.367
former president Trump
said he directed Eric Trump

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:18.834
not to testify again in the
$250 million civil fraud trial

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:21.234
because, you know,
he just saw him at Thanksgiving.

00:01:21.234 --> 00:01:24.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:26.167
Former Pennsylvania Senator
Rick Santorum

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:27.901
said in a recent interview
that at least two

00:01:27.901 --> 00:01:30.067
Republican presidential hopefuls
have reached out to him

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:32.934
for advice.
On what? A concession speech?

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:35.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.300
Lawmakers in Russia
recently set a date

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.634
for the country's
next presidential election --

00:01:39.634 --> 00:01:41.267
Februvember 40th.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:45.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.300
A deer rose --
A deer recently --

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.033
A deer recently
broke into an elementary school

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:51.801
in New Jersey --
and this is embarrassing --

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:53.601
won a spelling bee.

00:01:53.601 --> 00:01:55.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:56.501
This kid's good.

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:01.234
The roof of a double-decker bus
in England

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:03.501
was recently ripped off
after it hit a low bridge,

00:02:03.501 --> 00:02:04.934
and passengers were relieved

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:08.367
because they came this close
to having to finish the tour.

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:10.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:12.000
And if you look to your left,

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.133
you'll see an old wall
made of stones.

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:23.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.400
I laughed harder when I read
that than they collectively did

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.334
when I said it.

00:02:30.334 --> 00:02:35.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.567 --> 00:02:38.801
Then I do "wall of stones,"
standing ovation.

00:02:38.801 --> 00:02:40.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:42.534
Wait for them to calm down,
move on to the next joke.

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:43.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:45.267
According to new data,

00:02:45.267 --> 00:02:46.934
fewer Americans
are working from home.

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:49.234
Turns out they're mostly
just dicking around on the web.

00:02:49.234 --> 00:02:51.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.133
By the way, guy who wrote
that joke for me?

00:02:53.133 --> 00:02:54.000
Working from home.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.934
[ Laughter ]
There he is.

00:03:00.067 --> 00:03:03.067
Authorities in New Jersey
were recently called to capture

00:03:03.067 --> 00:03:05.334
a loose pig named
Albert Einswine...

00:03:05.334 --> 00:03:07.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.033 --> 00:03:08.968
...after it escaped
from its home.

00:03:08.968 --> 00:03:11.901
It was caught safely and
reunited with his brother,

00:03:11.901 --> 00:03:13.100
Sloppenheimer.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:17.234
Same guy wrote that joke.

00:03:17.234 --> 00:03:18.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.834 --> 00:03:20.434
Maybe less dicking around
on the web, Brian.

00:03:20.434 --> 00:03:21.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.501
Maybe you come back to work.
Look me in the [bleep] eyes

00:03:23.501 --> 00:03:24.501
when you write these jokes.

00:03:24.501 --> 00:03:26.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:29.067
Maybe not click send.

00:03:33.033 --> 00:03:35.367
And finally, a cargo ship
yesterday broke down

00:03:35.367 --> 00:03:37.801
in Egypt's Suez Canal
and crashed into a bridge.

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:38.968
And you're not
going to believe this.

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:40.801
Everything you just bought
for your family

00:03:40.801 --> 00:03:43.234
for the holidays was on it.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.234 --> 00:03:45.200
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.467
We've got a great show
for you tonight.

